        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "As they go around town the police hep peopleSometimes they find lost children.They take the children home.If the police see a fight, they put an end to it right away. Sometimes people wil ask the police how to get to a place in town. The police can alwys tell the peopl hich wy to goThey kow althe treets and roads wel.\n",
